{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cc35ff9290cc873a36edf997b80a4e7a84985b495b90419905f618e16dbfc4b7", "ja": "（今日は『りるきゃん』のグラビア撮影だ。翼は\nこの日を楽しみにしていたみたいだ。何故なら……）", "zh": "（今天要进行『Lilican』的写真拍摄。翼好像一直很期待这一天。因为……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "03017dadb8328f428eef4522ed30dd442cd90b66b4ef8bf2d75ed5d0b1fb9db4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせ！\n準備、できましたー♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让你久等啦！\n我已经准备好啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a7bd9231e6297ab763930183811a191ae9da5b6e5b452c88ccae103cc9c7a5b6", "ja": "やる気いっぱいだな、翼！", "zh": "干劲十足嘛，翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d7fb665459a220a410eb8d16e7c899bbbb7f47c0b83b87f670fd5b0b4cd8b2ac", "ja": "だって～。わたしたちの考えたマンガが、\nいよいよ『りるきゃん』に載るんですよ？", "zh": "因为嘛～我们一起想出来的漫画，终于要刊登在《Little Candy》上了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "532756e57cc4be25da0089ec7ae8b4493c0f85741c5ed3506a180360c165223f", "ja": "しかも巻頭グラビアが、わたしたちの特集！\nそんなの、すっごくうれしいじゃないですか～！", "zh": "而且卷首写真还是关于我们的专题！这不是让人超级开心嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1005_p", "source_sha256": "01412ea1bd45e59f896488ff792526478bdd6bcc063d258874e2513ccc6a1493", "ja": "そうだな。一から作った作品だ、感慨深いよな。\nたくさんの人に見てもらえるといいな！", "zh": "是啊。这可是从头开始创作的作品，真是感慨万千啊。\n要是能让更多人看到就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6b06ac6ddf086140608687bb00fb6cfea02b4cba78acf2654aaddd44c5da6b01", "ja": "わたしたちの考えたお話が、\n本当にマンガになっちゃうなんて……えへへ。", "zh": "我们构思的故事，居然真的要变成漫画了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3068b20d615d16acf0b4b9384b2399dd5c9df895237bfeeacd6f1076a30fd659", "ja": "だって、わたしたちが描いたネーム？っていうの。\nあれ、棒人間だったじゃないですか。", "zh": "因为，我们画的分镜草稿？好像是叫这个吧。\n那个不就是火柴人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "af12cc0cf341ca8559ccda7c84325fbdab869a6d46ef736716ed386cc2cc465e", "ja": "はは、そうだったな。漫画家さんが\n綺麗に下描きに起こしてくれてたけど。", "zh": "哈哈，确实是那样。虽然漫画家把它漂亮地画成了草稿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a9ce05f7db81b8039b3f159bd040f056318130b95440dc8f465bc4c6bdfc8f3", "ja": "そうなの！　おんなじ話なのに、わたしたちが\n描いたのと全然違って、すっごく絵がキレイだった！", "zh": "就是这样！明明是同一个故事，和我们画的完全不一样，画得特别漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4037d1db1f6c45aeb8c331c7dac4b6d8976bf992563272306e06f5f8a1375313", "ja": "それはまあ……相手は、プロだからな。", "zh": "那是当然……对方可是专业人士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d16084154ce95350c8c7825c1f0963887da75b651f145c41baf670e19d242bb5", "ja": "すごいですよねー！　どうしてこんなふうに\n上手に描けるの！？って、感動しちゃった。", "zh": "真的很厉害呢——！我都感动了，心想：“为什么能画得这么好啊！？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d39e2699a90c85c40e316eea5c8e1bf7859a0d458920f81c9428ed02dff7c96e", "ja": "きっと漫画家さんも、たくさん絵を練習して、\nそれでプロになったんですよね。", "zh": "漫画家一定也是练习了很多画画，才成为专业漫画家的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1013_p", "source_sha256": "41ab01396b2184f4101f3020046c411e217d6cd6d94e6c886fff15731f4312bb", "ja": "うん……そうだな。", "zh": "嗯……也是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9567def60ca6ab7e652e0abc400475b84525c4972ef13ad82b47d2446b356f13", "ja": "最初は、マンガを描いて500万円もらえるなんて、\nいいなーって思ったけど……。", "zh": "一开始，我觉得画漫画能拿到500万日元，\n真好啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e63c414032ea76428d91508e34f981f9c478cc731aae352bf125ba0a9621bb07", "ja": "でも、わたしはわたし！\nアイドルのお仕事を、がんばろうと思いまーす☆", "zh": "但是，我就是我！\n我要努力做好偶像的工作～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fa4270ec317abc5a973bac98badf75f2c394cc5f0660a2ebb56868f0786531ff", "ja": "うん、そうだな。翼のアイドルだって、\n充分すごいことだからな。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。毕竟作为偶像的翼，\n就已经十分了不起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8a20396dd9c0db3c1663c600a5b70bef475e666f78a7fd1738f1f304971f864a", "ja": "えへへ、そうですよね♪　アイドル、毎日楽しいし、\nわたしにピッタリだし♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，说得对呢♪　当偶像每天都很开心，也很适合我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1018_p", "source_sha256": "53bc660aa84793018d3c06a46ecbc16c3fb76cae079bd52f19a002d18d9c152e", "ja": "それなら何よりだ。……おっと、そろそろ始まるな。\n翼、準備はいいか？", "zh": "那就再好不过了。……哎呀，差不多要开始了。翼，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0593_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a8151a1cf07401b9ad21b379ba0b6b8f3e01d15d009f7a430d9e9251674ce51b", "ja": "は～い！　マンガの主人公と同じくらい、\nかわいく撮ってもらっちゃおーっと♪", "zh": "好～！我要被拍得和漫画主角一样可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
